## Third-party assets

The bundled metronome tones (`app/src/main/res/raw/*.wav`) are derived from
sound effects published by BigSoundBank, released into the public domain
under CC0. The original transients were extracted and converted to 16-bit PCM.

The app icon is an original work created for this project.
